{"title":"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a rectangle with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/235e58b6a077ef9b4e2372c3ea5b53ddbccffa59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB &gt; BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd985f15cc7042c5eed567ad214c710eefa646b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PD = PB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62b429f5168c6870a4070a8beb855c402e0538f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PD = 53$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e5188fc52c0abb471c46b4b2283321afa68262a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />. Determine the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd985f15cc7042c5eed567ad214c710eefa646b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PD = PB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62b429f5168c6870a4070a8beb855c402e0538f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PD = 53$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb54c0e3e5a53a2c3ea57a0c56abb843c527786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PB = 53$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Using the quadratic formula, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/8/ae8d83a4f0a345c9b94e6700b7da0bf6247b6532.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC^{2} + BC^{2} = PB^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/1/4c193abac3b82400b848ae9cf2dc048ec25da29f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC^{2} + 28^{2} = 53^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/3/3630ee73ab47bafad26af0c3f8646a5c64254277.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC^{2} + 784 = 2809$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ec029c3d5ba3e1e3993add96843486294e6c96d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC^{2} = 2809 - 784 = 2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b81f49500018a874d12d419540af1881d0b918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13eb94b713cc58468590735dea2f77c2500545c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC = \\sqrt{2025} = 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e049532148caaf1c48e37658b548a6255c8d59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d6394023b7f71962bce796b61343dcc276679c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PD$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> combine to form side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/34036f1d323841ae3fad517ce2b81a84d624e731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD = 45 + 53 = 98$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Opposite sides of a rectangle are equal, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9a427387ff6212e24b2c3bf3ce692b2e62d50a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = CD$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/1/c9152caf4f6ddc10ee78a81ef773df0d3c4f6405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{AB = 98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"84\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065801\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 91/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1020/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4088/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.673      1 2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\n100.00%   13.673      1 -total\n 39.44%    5.393      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37465:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065801 and revision id 289501. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}